<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime suspect in the 2013 Baniyas massacre was arrested and the alleged “Butcher of Baniyas&amp;quot; Ali Kayali was captured by Syrian security forces, while two men were sentenced to death for violent attacks and another pair received death sentences for coastal clashes. Turkish forces detained the chief suspect in the 2013 Turkey Reyhanlı attack who fled into Syria, and Turkish, Israeli and Kurdish actors continue to contest Syria's new order. Gunmen posing as security forces abducted a Kurdish woman law student in Damascus, and four road security personnel were killed in an eastern Hama attack. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBjY245VUZyaXhiU3hueFBkeWJfLU9LcXdESDFIQldES0J6QWhOODFjbHMtZFRPYUpOTmZSTWl1RFNOYU50SlZyVmVzTHdESjVpM2k4aU9saktqdHVpV2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTFBKNjFpeUNWcjZaZFpSN296UldKdC1nQUxIMlNjV0xfaGVxWjFrVGNFOEZ2S3hBMHJadU5pZ19EVjR0bEJQRVpzS21IOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQbG05MzhINjBSMEQ3MmZFSjRNeTVaX25DREI2clFtLU9Kdld0OFhkcVlkYWZKY2ZEeEZEU096OUZCYmZqUTMxOHdZbXRiWk53QXdRNjhSUWl5b3ZWNDNYWVB0MzRZSmg2a040S2Rpb0x2Z2tWLVNzMDFTbk1Dbm9zc1NtMzkwRGJrLUR1eHY2WWZCNnBCTk82dWd5TmZmem1ZNkNrSUhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5CbWMwbHBLQ1BJZV84Y2RpVTNlM1ZXd1ZPd1NhVndycTRWRTFwS2lKODgyVDB3T3RXOFM4THJrTXY0WTduQWdWTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxORWZROTNDcHlUSnVJeHFha0pla1F6YnhfN2ZJYWJ5UUg2RjJFd3Vyc1duTmRpNUtiU1lSVl9rV2U2NjI0TU9UZU5OMWE3bkRvQUZWYkNYSWVkNDFYaG9VZHViNEZCMzBld3BqSmpOWkpxdDI1ZmdCUGdSWkhzbTlGUF